--- !u!114 &1077608277
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1077608275}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f5e792a0ce450e648b41cad081372b66, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 1074766029}
  lines:
  - After the success in Crystal Forest, Ase quickly heads to Sky Ruins of the realm
    of Aether. But Sky Ruins is not what it once was.
  - Due to Eclipse's emergence, the stars that once lit up the sky has now fallen
    onto the ground.
  - 'In order to defeat Eclipse, Ase now has to make use of the villain''s biggest
    weakness: glow. This can be done by using the glow of collected crystals and
    stars.'
  - But the task will not be easy as Eclipse does everything in his power to stop
    Ase. As a matter of fact, the villain has sent out his minions to get the glowing
    hero.
  - Unbeknownst to them, Ase has a new ability that will be useful in the pursue
    of Eclipse...
  textSpeed: 0.02
