  textComponent: {fileID: 1501482249}
  lines:
  - 'ECLIPSE: Well, well, well. Look who''s here. The light of the world, the sunshine,
    ASE...'
  - 'ECLIPSE: You cannot destroy the light. '
  - 'ASE: Maybe not.'
  - 'ECLIPSE: Then why fight?'
  - 'ASE: Because even the longest night ends. '
  - 'ASE: And then sun always rises.'
  - 'ECLIPSE: Darkness always returns though. You''re just delaying the inevitable.'
  - 'ASE: No.'
  - 'ASE: I''m proving it can be beaten.'
  textSpeed: 0.02
